### Запити для розширення REST Client (VS Code). Сервер: go run .
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Створення інциденту (201 Created)
POST {{base}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Overheating on Gateway-01","description":"Core temperature reached 85C","priority":"critical"}

### 2. Невалідний пріоритет (400 Bad Request)
POST {{base}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Disk failure","description":"RAID degraded","priority":"urgent"}

### 3. Короткий заголовок і відсутній опис (400 Bad Request)
POST {{base}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"ab","priority":"low"}

### 4. Список інцидентів (200 OK)
GET {{base}}/incidents

### 5. Інцидент за ID (200 OK)
GET {{base}}/incidents/1

### 6. Неіснуючий інцидент (404 Not Found)
GET {{base}}/incidents/999

### 7. Зміна статусу (200 OK)
PATCH {{base}}/incidents/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"in_progress"}

### 8. Невалідний статус (400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{base}}/incidents/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"done"}

### 9. Видалення (204 No Content)
DELETE {{base}}/incidents/1

### 10. Реєстрація (201 Created)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"engineer@company.internal","password":"SuperSecretPassword123"}

### 11. Повторна реєстрація (409 Conflict)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"engineer@company.internal","password":"SuperSecretPassword123"}

### 12. Вхід (200 OK + JWT)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"engineer@company.internal","password":"SuperSecretPassword123"}

### 13. Невірний пароль (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"engineer@company.internal","password":"WrongPassword"}
